This library contains work by others, under their own terms:

The reverb kernel in src/cloudseed is a port of Cloud Seed by Valdemar
Erlingsson (https://github.com/ValdemarOrn/CloudSeed), released under the MIT
License, Copyright (c) 2018 Valdemar Erlingsson. Its factory programs in
src/cloudseed/presets.h are the plugin's.

The Dark Plate program in src/cloudseed/presets.h is adapted from the
built-in program of Cloud Seed 2's core by Ghost Note Engineering Ltd
(https://github.com/GhostNoteAudio/CloudSeedCore), released under the MIT
License, Copyright (c) 2024 Ghost Note Engineering Ltd.

The SHA-256 implementation in src/cloudseed/sha_random.cpp is by Olivier Gay
(Modified BSD License; the notice is in the file).

The argument reduction in src/cloudseed/fdlibm_trig.cpp and its reference in
test/trig.cpp are derived from fdlibm, Copyright (C) 1993 by Sun
Microsystems, Inc. ("Permission to use, copy, modify, and distribute this
software is freely granted, provided that this notice is preserved.")

The license texts of these works are reproduced in src/cloudseed/license.txt.
